.SH NAME
ivcap-context-dataset-grant - Grant read or write access to a dataset


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBivcap context dataset grant dataset_urn (--project  | --service  | --everyone) --access read|write [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Grant a project, a service principal or everyone access to a dataset. Granting
to everyone is read-only. Granting to a project needs share rights on the
dataset and write access on that project.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--access\fP=""
	Access level: read or write

